---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Price Drop Radar">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 prose prose-slate">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-8">Effective Date: August 23, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      By accessing Price Drop Radar, you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Product Pricing & Availability Disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      All prices, discounts, and product availability are subject to change without notice on retailer websites. Price Drop Radar makes no warranty regarding the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of product listings. Final purchases occur on third-party merchant sites (such as Amazon.com) and are governed by their respective terms and return policies.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Price Drop Radar and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from product purchases, pricing discrepancies, or merchant fulfillment.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
